# The manual's pages on the system's /usr/man, which tools/mkman.py
# formats: a directory and the sources of its pages, relative to usr/src
# (docs/userland.md).  Sections 1 and 8 have the page of each program on
# the system, wherever its source is, and the introduction to each; 2, 3,
# 5 and 7, the kernel's calls, the libraries, the files and the rest,
# are all of upstream's, what the Makefile of each formats, with those of
# the programs here; 4 has those not about the PDP-11's devices; 6 those
# of the games here.  3f, Fortran's library, has nothing here to go with
# it.

cat1	man/man1/intro.1 man/man1/cd.1 man/man1/wait.1

